// Physical scalar diphoton decay with matched F/C fiducial phase space
// Pure diphoton Dirac model: Gamma_total = Gamma_gammagamma = 10 GeV
// The monopole mass solves the Coulombic diphoton coupling for this width, no measured branching fraction is claimed
// [REFERENCE: arXiv:0809.0272, Eqs. (5) and (6)]
